From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Baptiste Augrain <daiyam@zokugun.org>
Date: Sat, 1 Jan 2000 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: add configurable font size and family for workbench parts (sidebar,
 activity bar, panel, tabs, status bar)

Stock VS Code only exposes editor font settings, leaving the sidebar, activity bar, panel, tabs and status bar text unsizable. Adds experimental `workbench.*.experimental.fontSize`/`fontFamily` settings that drive per-part CSS variables through a shared `font.ts` helper, scaling icons, padding and separators proportionally so each part stays aligned at any size.

Co-authored-by: xiaolai <lixiaolai@gmail.com>

